1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,537
Under the all-powerful
Administrator's rule,

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:08,540
this world entered a long period of
peace and the people became apathetic.

3
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:13,600
Seventy years had passed since
Quinella became Administrator.

4
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:19,420
Then, one day, she realized
she'd undergone a change.

5
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:27,977
She used her control command
to examine her Fluctlight and

6
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:31,707
discovered it had reached its
capacity to retain her memories.

7
00:00:33,580 --> 00:00:38,780
She refused to accept it, so she came
up with another monstrous solution.

8
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,160
Welcome, child.

9
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:44,960
Please, come closer.

10
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:46,560
Yes, ma 'am.

11
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:50,277
If I can overwrite her Fluctlight with a

12
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:52,937
copy of the thoughts and
memories from my own,

13
00:00:53,020 --> 00:00:54,700
I will never lose them.

14
00:00:55,420 --> 00:00:56,720
Close your eyes.

15
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:02,600
It was a diabolical ceremony.

16
00:01:04,380 --> 00:01:08,940
A fusing of soul and memory, which
she called the Synthesis Ritual.

17
00:01:10,140 --> 00:01:13,940
With it, she could seize control
of another human's Fluctlight.

18
00:01:14,820 --> 00:01:15,650
Right.

19
00:01:15,733 --> 00:01:20,700
And here was where Administrator, or
Quinella, made a critical mistake.

20
00:01:21,180 --> 00:01:22,180
What do you mean?

21
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:25,477
It didn't occur to her
that during the process of

22
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:28,277
taking over the young girl
and deleting her old self,

23
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:31,057
there would be a split
second where two gods

24
00:01:31,140 --> 00:01:33,740
with equal power existed at the same time.

25
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:38,746
Kirito, you are familiar with my
original version, are you not?

26
00:01:39,340 --> 00:01:41,817
What is the main feature
of the cardinal system?

27
00:01:41,900 --> 00:01:47,680
Oh, um, it's supposed to operate
automatically for long periods of time.

28
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,737
It doesn't need humans to run.

29
00:01:49,820 --> 00:01:50,761
That is correct.

30
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:52,260
And to facilitate it,

31
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:56,951
the Cardinal System has two core programs,
a main process and a sub-process.

32
00:01:57,320 --> 00:02:00,860
The main process performs
balance controls on the system.

33
00:02:01,100 --> 00:02:04,360
While the sub-process runs
error checks on the main.

34
00:02:05,020 --> 00:02:06,320
Precisely.

35
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:08,357
When she became administrator,

36
00:02:08,440 --> 00:02:10,357
the preservation of order wasn't the only

37
00:02:10,440 --> 00:02:12,969
thing Queeniella etched
onto her Fluctlight.

38
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:18,407
In the recesses of her soul, I still
functioned as the sub-process to her main.

39
00:02:18,960 --> 00:02:21,900
And I was obligated to correct her errors.

40
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:28,740
For 70 long years, I
waited for my opportunity.

41
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:33,300
And finally, it had arrived!

42
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,190
вод

43
00:03:04,980 --> 00:03:07,017
I'm so sick, and I'll take the sleep.

44
00:03:07,100 --> 00:03:12,400
I'm so sick, and I'll get
to know how to get started.

45
00:03:13,340 --> 00:03:16,857
I'm so sick, and I see
many pieces of death.

46
00:03:16,940 --> 00:03:19,120
I'm a person who calls me to say,

47
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:24,000
I'm starting to come to a new goal.

48
00:03:25,760 --> 00:03:28,520
I'm a person who is looking for me.

49
00:03:29,540 --> 00:03:31,577
The shining sun is my diamond.

50
00:03:31,660 --> 00:03:34,517
Ellery, shi ni to ne
neen kek so yo sa jai?

51
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:36,817
Bokra shikai, se cha!

52
00:03:36,900 --> 00:03:39,837
Se zari no shikai wo Miss Sheyta ku.

53
00:03:39,920 --> 00:03:42,937
Nano date Cait jika te mo.

54
00:03:43,020 --> 00:03:44,697
Bokokyo ama de ki Dyne.

55
00:03:44,780 --> 00:03:47,797
Itsunai me iku no ienoni akak?

56
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:50,060
Kakume no tak shot sa kakakakiake!

57
00:04:11,580 --> 00:04:13,000
It worked.

58
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:15,920
This little girl's Fluctlight is mine now.

59
00:04:16,720 --> 00:04:17,920
System call.

60
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:20,680
Generate luminous element.

61
00:04:21,140 --> 00:04:22,340
Lightning shape.

62
00:04:22,780 --> 00:04:24,760
Discharge! What?

63
00:04:26,940 --> 00:04:28,280
System call.

64
00:04:30,480 --> 00:04:33,180
Generate luminous element. System call.

65
00:04:33,460 --> 00:04:35,320
Generate umbra element.

66
00:04:35,560 --> 00:04:37,800
Ball shape. Discharge.

67
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:42,110
System call.

68
00:04:42,420 --> 00:04:43,620
Redefine object.

69
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:47,160
Sword class.

70
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:49,280
System call.

71
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,940
Redefine object.

72
00:04:51,720 --> 00:04:52,720
Rod class.

73
00:04:53,220 --> 00:04:57,120
System call. Change. Field. Attribute.

74
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,310
No!

75
00:05:01,393 --> 00:05:04,280
She made this area off-limits
for System Commands!

76
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:21,600
I can't defeat her in this body!

77
00:05:35,700 --> 00:05:36,760
System Call!

78
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,980
Generate Aerial Elements!

79
00:05:39,360 --> 00:05:40,240
Stream Shape!

80
00:05:43,200 --> 00:05:48,082
There are only two locations in this world
which Administrator has no control over.

81
00:05:49,020 --> 00:05:51,549
One is the other side
of the End Mountains.

82
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:54,000
The other is...

83
00:05:57,520 --> 00:05:58,580
System call!

84
00:05:59,540 --> 00:06:02,000
Generate Blizzard Gate! Zero-one!

85
00:06:04,320 --> 00:06:05,820
The Great Library!

86
00:06:08,980 --> 00:06:13,160
In an instant, this space was
completely isolated from the outside.

87
00:06:14,460 --> 00:06:18,840
For the past 200 years, I've
been watching and plotting.

88
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:24,360
I waited for the perfect moment, when I
could catch her off guard, then ambush her.

89
00:06:25,420 --> 00:06:28,820
She knew what I was up to
and was constantly on guard,

90
00:06:29,060 --> 00:06:32,580
so she created powerful and
loyal servants for protection.

91
00:06:33,860 --> 00:06:36,060
Through the Synthesis Ritual,

92
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:41,560
this man will be reborn as a
warrior devoted only to me,

93
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:44,220
my Integrity Knight.

94
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:49,117
The first one she turned into
an Integrity Knight was an

95
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:52,520
exceptional swordsman who
hated the rule of the Church.

96
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:54,840
Seeking refuge from it,

97
00:06:55,220 --> 00:06:58,808
he and his companions founded
a village in the outer regions.

98
00:06:59,060 --> 00:07:03,220
The name of this knight
was Bercouli Synthesis 1.

99
00:07:05,540 --> 00:07:09,080
One-on-one, Administrator
and I are equally matched.

100
00:07:09,340 --> 00:07:10,340
At least we were.

101
00:07:10,880 --> 00:07:12,880
Her knights are fast and powerful.

102
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:16,280
They made the prospect of
ambushing her impossible.

103
00:07:16,940 --> 00:07:20,697
So, at the risk of being spotted,
I sought out my own allies.

104
00:07:20,780 --> 00:07:23,480
I opened doorways far from the cathedral,

105
00:07:23,940 --> 00:07:27,537
then cast sensory-sharing
spells upon birds and insects

106
00:07:27,620 --> 00:07:31,240
and sent them out to lead
potential allies back here to me.

107
00:07:36,980 --> 00:07:38,500
Look here.

108
00:07:40,160 --> 00:07:41,300
Meet Charlotte.

109
00:07:41,760 --> 00:07:44,837
She spotted you and Eugeo
in Rulid and has been

110
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:48,096
tagging along with you ever
since you left that place.

111
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:51,440
Sometimes, she did more
than just tag along.

112
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:56,725
She was the one guiding me when
we were running from that night.

113
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:57,940
Huh, sneaky.

114
00:07:58,820 --> 00:08:03,800
So back when my Zophilias got chopped
up, was that you giving me the pep talk?

115
00:08:05,840 --> 00:08:07,020
She's a shy one.

116
00:08:07,420 --> 00:08:09,360
Of all my observation units,

117
00:08:09,740 --> 00:08:12,737
Charlotte has been out searching
longer than the others.

118
00:08:12,820 --> 00:08:14,880
At last, she can rest now.

119
00:08:15,100 --> 00:08:16,806
Her mission's come to an end.

120
00:08:17,380 --> 00:08:21,320
When I enlisted her, I froze the
natural degradation of her life.

121
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:23,640
That was over 200 years ago.

122
00:08:25,100 --> 00:08:26,159
Thanks, Charlotte.

123
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:32,540
So for 200 years, you had critters like
her out in the world looking for help,

124
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:35,327
and you've been stuck
in here the whole time?

125
00:08:35,800 --> 00:08:36,630
Indeed.

126
00:08:36,820 --> 00:08:40,157
And as I sat here, observing
the world through their eyes,

127
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,820
a question kept repeating.

128
00:08:42,940 --> 00:08:45,977
Why would the gods of the
outside abandon a world they

129
00:08:46,060 --> 00:08:49,420
created to suffer under the
tyranny of Administrator,

130
00:08:49,520 --> 00:08:50,420
a false god.

131
00:08:51,520 --> 00:08:54,377
As I pondered this and
referred to the Cardinal

132
00:08:54,460 --> 00:08:56,960
System's built-in database over and over,

133
00:08:57,340 --> 00:08:59,516
I eventually arrived at a conclusion.

134
00:09:00,400 --> 00:09:02,120
Wrath may be the god here,

135
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:05,732
but it doesn't want the people
to lead happy lives at all.

136
00:09:05,940 --> 00:09:07,340
It wants the opposite.

137
00:09:08,660 --> 00:09:10,060
This is a test.

138
00:09:11,640 --> 00:09:15,077
Wrath created the underworld
so they can observe how

139
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:18,219
its people react to stress
perimeters put upon them.

140
00:09:19,320 --> 00:09:21,220
Day by day, they increase.

141
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:22,830
Eventually,

142
00:09:22,913 --> 00:09:24,737
all those stressors
will reach their limit,

143
00:09:24,820 --> 00:09:27,517
and the final phase of
the test will be at hand.

144
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:28,659
Then what happens?

145
00:09:28,980 --> 00:09:33,140
What these people fear the most, an
invasion from outside this realm.

146
00:09:33,980 --> 00:09:36,600
The Dark Territory. Correct.

147
00:09:37,420 --> 00:09:40,097
The World of Darkness
was created to subject

148
00:09:40,180 --> 00:09:42,620
the Underworldians to the ultimate agony.

149
00:09:43,660 --> 00:09:46,778
The monsters there have
Fluctlights just like humans.

150
00:09:47,160 --> 00:09:51,900
The difference is, their prime
directive is to plunder and slaughter.

151
00:09:52,980 --> 00:09:56,497
They're eager for the day when they
can breach the land of the Eums,

152
00:09:56,580 --> 00:09:57,537
as they call you,

153
00:09:57,620 --> 00:09:58,680
and wreak havoc.

154
00:09:59,280 --> 00:10:00,600
That day is coming.

155
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:04,664
And Administrator, does
she know they're coming?

156
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:07,300
Yes, but she underestimates them.

157
00:10:07,540 --> 00:10:11,077
She thinks she and her Integrity
Knights are strong enough to repel them.

158
00:10:11,160 --> 00:10:16,560
She even had all four guardian dragons
slain, north, south, east, and west.

159
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:21,134
As allies, they would have been
valuable, but she could not control them.

160
00:10:21,660 --> 00:10:26,040
Pity, she cannot win now, for the
forces of darkness are too many,

161
00:10:26,300 --> 00:10:29,240
and her numbers are too few. Hang on.

162
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:32,504
If that's true, then why
bother taking her down?

163
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:36,977
Because it sounds like the fate of this
world sealed whether you do or don't.

164
00:10:37,060 --> 00:10:38,340
You are correct.

165
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:40,880
No matter what I do,

166
00:10:41,260 --> 00:10:45,731
the Dark Territory will invade the human
realm, and there is no stopping it.

167
00:10:45,820 --> 00:10:48,520
So, like, once you stop Administrator,

168
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:52,073
your job here is done and
whatever else happens, happens.

169
00:10:52,940 --> 00:10:54,400
You don't care, do you?

170
00:10:56,860 --> 00:10:58,120
Perhaps I don't.

171
00:11:02,040 --> 00:11:02,870
However...

172
00:11:02,953 --> 00:11:05,720
Wrath engineered the
bloodshed that is to come.

173
00:11:06,480 --> 00:11:08,598
I cannot accept a god who does that.

174
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:13,240
Once I learned the load test
was unavoidable, I decided.

175
00:11:14,140 --> 00:11:20,820
The human realm and the dark territory
must be returned to nothingness.

176
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:22,840
Hold up. Decided?

177
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:24,296
That is what I said.

178
00:11:24,580 --> 00:11:26,140
When I regain control,

179
00:11:26,400 --> 00:11:29,897
I will access the flux light
stored in the light cube cluster.

180
00:11:29,980 --> 00:11:34,760
Then I will delete every resident of
the realms of humanity and darkness.

181
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:36,550
That said,

182
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:40,500
if you decide to help me, and
I eliminate Administrator,

183
00:11:40,780 --> 00:11:43,545
I will have full access
to all of my authority.

184
00:11:44,020 --> 00:11:47,900
Then, before I extinguish this
world, I can grant you one wish.

185
00:11:48,260 --> 00:11:50,240
To a certain degree, anyway.

186
00:11:50,620 --> 00:11:53,257
If you single out those
you would like to save,

187
00:11:53,340 --> 00:11:56,105
I will refrain from
deleting their floodlights.

188
00:11:56,380 --> 00:11:58,240
Instead, I will archive them.

189
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:03,701
After you escape to the real world,
you can save their light cubes.

190
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:07,140
I should be able to set aside ten or so.

191
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,760
I got a pick.

192
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:14,780
Wait a sec.

193
00:12:15,660 --> 00:12:17,425
Something doesn't add up here.

194
00:12:17,700 --> 00:12:19,818
You said your soul's a copy of hers.

195
00:12:20,260 --> 00:12:24,025
That means you got the selfish
part of the nobility in you, too.

196
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:28,520
The drive to put your wants and
needs above everyone else's.

197
00:12:28,820 --> 00:12:30,977
So why'd you wait here all by yourself?

198
00:12:31,060 --> 00:12:32,660
And for two hundred years?

199
00:12:33,740 --> 00:12:38,622
You could have found a place far away from
Administrator and had some kind of life.

200
00:12:39,580 --> 00:12:42,400
The Cardinal's sub-process
was burned into me.

201
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:45,820
That means my core desires
amount to only one thing.

202
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:49,880
To eliminate Administrator and
restore normal function here.

203
00:12:50,420 --> 00:12:51,280
To me,

204
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:54,317
there is no way to have a
properly functioning world unless

205
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:58,106
the corrupting element is dealt
with and the slate wiped clean.

206
00:12:58,300 --> 00:13:00,840
Actually, on second thought...

207
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:03,660
Perhaps you're right.

208
00:13:03,960 --> 00:13:05,820
I do harbor one desire.

209
00:13:06,280 --> 00:13:11,500
Something I was desperate to experience
just once for the last two hundred years.

210
00:13:14,060 --> 00:13:16,120
Kirito, would you stand up, please?

211
00:13:26,960 --> 00:13:28,040
This should do.

212
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:30,186
Alright, please step forward.

213
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:35,020
Come closer. Why?

214
00:13:35,420 --> 00:13:36,596
Don't argue with me.

215
00:13:40,160 --> 00:13:42,580
Raise your arms, please. Like this?

216
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:45,527
In front of you, and
make a circle with them.

217
00:13:48,160 --> 00:13:50,160
Honestly, how dense are you?

218
00:13:58,360 --> 00:13:59,940
So this is it.

219
00:14:01,220 --> 00:14:02,460
Now I see.

220
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:04,980
This is what it means to be human.

221
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:12,540
To be held.

222
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:15,320
It's so warm and comforting.

223
00:14:15,820 --> 00:14:19,960
After 200 years, this
makes the wait worth it.

224
00:14:20,160 --> 00:14:24,100
To think something so simple
could be so satisfying.

225
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:27,420
The wait was more than worth it.

226
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:42,473
Well, how long are you planning
to stand there like that?

227
00:14:43,020 --> 00:14:44,680
Sorry, just being human.

228
00:14:45,060 --> 00:14:47,640
So then, what's your decision?

229
00:14:49,020 --> 00:14:51,860
Will you help me stop
Administrator, or not?

230
00:14:54,860 --> 00:14:55,740
Yeah, okay.

231
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:57,957
I'll help you with this plan of yours.

232
00:14:58,040 --> 00:14:58,870
Sort of.

233
00:14:59,920 --> 00:15:02,567
Look, I get where you're
coming from and all.

234
00:15:03,040 --> 00:15:05,157
But I'm not gonna give up on this world!

235
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:07,400
And I won't give up on its people!

236
00:15:08,420 --> 00:15:12,067
I'll help you, but I'll still
try and find a way to save them.

237
00:15:12,420 --> 00:15:14,860
Honestly, your optimism is absurd?

238
00:15:15,500 --> 00:15:16,420
Maybe so.

239
00:15:16,900 --> 00:15:19,460
But if everything gets deleted, so do you.

240
00:15:20,400 --> 00:15:22,257
If I can't figure this out,

241
00:15:22,340 --> 00:15:26,164
You can bet you'll be one of the
ten people I'm gonna want saved.

242
00:15:27,520 --> 00:15:29,197
Could you be any more foolish?

243
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:33,217
How do you expect me to extinguish
this world if I am not present?

244
00:15:33,300 --> 00:15:34,877
To perform the task, don't know.

245
00:15:34,960 --> 00:15:36,997
Hey, I'll do whatever you say,

246
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:40,962
but I'm gonna try to come up With
a better solution, all the same.

247
00:15:43,940 --> 00:15:47,177
Someday you too will know the
bitterness of resignation.

248
00:15:47,260 --> 00:15:50,797
It is not the same as trying and Failing.

249
00:15:50,880 --> 00:15:57,160
It is being forced to admit failure
regardless of how hard you try.

250
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,797
There you are.

251
00:16:06,880 --> 00:16:09,737
We thought you were still in the bath.

252
00:16:09,820 --> 00:16:12,920
I'm sorry, I guess I lost track of time.

253
00:16:13,740 --> 00:16:15,977
So uh, cardinal and I were talking.

